WEBVTT

00:00:29.236 --> 00:00:33.876
three out of four people
lived in squatter areas.

00:00:33.876 --> 00:00:36.716
You probably don't even know
what is a squatter area,

00:00:36.716 --> 00:00:39.876
but in those days,
it was just all over town.

00:00:40.916 --> 00:00:46.756
So the government of Singapore decided

00:00:46.756 --> 00:00:51.196
that, if we want to have
a sustainable city,

00:00:51.236 --> 00:00:55.636
compatible with all the other,
larger countries,

00:00:55.636 --> 00:00:58.436
we must achieve excellence.

00:00:58.476 --> 00:01:03.356
And one of the signs
of removing backwardness